  - e-governance
  - India
  - National Blockchain Framework
  - public sector
  - TOE framework
  - Frictionless Data Package
abstract: >-
  Standardised, source-linked inventory of 117 blockchain/DLT initiatives by Indian
  public bodies (Union, all 28 States and 8 UTs, regulators, courts, statutory bodies),
  with dated lifecycle events, TOE-coded challenges, evidence scores, ISO 3166-2 and LGD
  codes, and a time series of the NIC blockchain platform (2024–2026).
